OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboy origins of Wolves to be
OL,4,Ahonoured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blue plaque commemorating the origins
OL,7,Fof Wolverhampton Wanderers is to be
OL,8,Finstalled outside a city primary school
OL,9,Fahead of the club's 150th anniversary.
OL,11,FThe plaque marks the role played by two
OL,12,F13-year-old pupils at St Luke's School
OL,13,Fin Blakenhall, whose efforts led to the
OL,14,Fformation of a football team that later
OL,15,Fbecame Wolves.
OL,17,FDavid Dungar, chairman of the
OL,18,FWolverhampton Society, said the plaque
OL,19,Fwas "of massive significance" to the
OL,20,Fcity because it celebrated the birth of
OL,21,F"the world-famous Wolves".
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
