OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboy origins of Wolves to be
OL,4,Ahonoured
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plaque tells the story of friends
OL,7,FJohn Baynton and John Brodie, who were
OL,8,Fencouraged by their head teacher Harry
OL,9,FBarcroft to form a football team in
OL,10,FNovember 1876.
